{# Skills are indexed, never inlined and never filtered: one line per page with its name, its file and
   the `when:` trigger that says who should open it. The trigger does the gating (`lang-c` says "you
   write C", `rocprof` says "you are about to profile an AMD device"), so the prompt need not know a
   task's language to decide what to show. `when` falls back to `description`, so a page without an
   authored trigger still gets a usable line. #}
{% if other_skills %}
## Skills
Each line below names a page under `{{ shared_dir }}/skills/`. Read the page before you act on its
subject: the line is the trigger and not the guidance. No page is repeated in this prompt.
{% for skill in other_skills %}
- **{{ skill.name }}** ({{ skill.file or skill.name }}.md) -- {{ skill.when or skill.description }}
{% if debug %}# Generated from: {{ skill.path }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
